OL,3,AAndrew Scott feels the Pressure as
OL,4,A'unsung hero' in WW2 thriller
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Scott says he loved the
OL,7,Fchallenge of his latest acting role in
OL,8,Fthe film Pressure, as the meteorologist
OL,9,Fkey to the success of World War Two's
OL,10,FD-Day - the largest seaborne invasion
OL,11,Fin history.
OL,13,F"Group Captain James Stagg may not have
OL,14,Fbeen the most charming person, but I
OL,15,Fthink he had a huge amount of humility
OL,16,Fin the face of nature. And that's one
OL,17,Fof the themes I think of the film,"
OL,18,FScott tells the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,165,160,200,105,0,100
